.\" Manpage for yagura
.TH YAGURA 1 "May 2026" "yagura 0.5.0" "Portfolio Orchestrator"
.SH NAME
yagura \- portfolio orchestrator daemon for GitHub projects via MCP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yagura
[\fIsubcommand\fR] [\fIargs...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B yagura
(\fI櫓\fR) is a single-binary daemon that tracks dozens of GitHub repositories
as a portfolio. It exposes 12 MCP (Model Context Protocol) tools over JSON-RPC 2.0
and serves a minimal HTML dashboard. Background scanners fetch GitHub status,
OpenSSF Scorecard scores, OSV.dev vulnerability data, and detect leaked secrets
in project text fields.
.PP
Yagura is part of the Sovereign Computing Stack and sits one layer above
.BR mihari (1):
where Mihari watches a single repository for events, Yagura tracks the
portfolio as a whole.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B (default)
Start the daemon. Listens on \fBYAGURA_ADDR\fR (default \fI127.0.0.1:8080\fR).
Spawns GitHub scanner (5-min cycle), security scanner (24-hour cycle),
and HTTP server with MCP, dashboard, healthz/readyz, metrics endpoints.
.TP
.B verify
Verify the SHA-256 hash chain of the append-only audit log under
\fI$YAGURA_STATE_DIR/audit/\fR. Detects tampering at byte level.
.TP
.B version
Print version string and exit.
.TP
.B help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
\fBsecret\fR \fIsubcommand\fR
Manage local AES-256-GCM encrypted secret store. Passphrase via
\fBYAGURA_SECRET_PASSPHRASE\fR environment variable.
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsecret set\fR \fIname\fR — read stdin, encrypt, store as \fIname.enc\fR
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsecret get\fR \fIname\fR — decrypt and print to stdout
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsecret list\fR — list stored secret names
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsecret delete\fR \fIname\fR — remove (idempotent)
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
.B YAGURA_ADDR
HTTP bind address. Default \fI127.0.0.1:8080\fR. Use \fI0.0.0.0:N\fR for
all interfaces (requires authentication via \fBYAGURA_MCP_TOKEN\fR).
.TP
.B YAGURA_STATE_DIR
Persistent state directory. Default \fI$HOME/.yagura\fR. Contains
\fIprojects/\fR, \fIaudit/\fR, \fIsecrets/\fR subdirectories.
.TP
.B YAGURA_GITHUB_TOKEN
Required. GitHub personal access token (PAT). Must have \fIrepo:status\fR,
\fIread:org\fR, and \fIrepo\fR (read-only) scopes.
.TP
.B YAGURA_MCP_TOKEN
Optional. If set, MCP endpoint at \fI/mcp\fR requires \fIAuthorization: Bearer\fR
header. Compared with constant-time \fBsubtle.ConstantTimeCompare\fR.
.TP
.B YAGURA_SCAN_INTERVAL
GitHub scan period. Default \fI5m\fR. Minimum \fI30s\fR.
.TP
.B YAGURA_SECURITY_SCAN_INTERVAL
Scorecard + OSV scan period. Default \fI24h\fR. Minimum \fI1h\fR.
.TP
.B YAGURA_LOG_LEVEL
\fIdebug\fR, \fIinfo\fR (default), \fIwarn\fR, \fIerror\fR.
.TP
.B YAGURA_ENABLE_PPROF
Opt-in for \fI/debug/pprof/\fR endpoints. Default \fIfalse\fR.
.TP
.B YAGURA_AUDIT_KEEP_DAYS
Audit log retention. Default \fI90\fR. Set \fI0\fR for unlimited.
.TP
.B YAGURA_SECRET_PASSPHRASE
Required for \fBsecret get/set\fR subcommands.
.SH ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B GET /healthz
Liveness probe. Always returns 200 if the process is alive.
.TP
.B GET /readyz
Readiness probe. Returns 503 during shutdown drain.
.TP
.B GET /metrics
Prometheus text exposition. Includes scan counters, project gauges,
HTTP request histograms.
.TP
.B GET /dashboard
Single-page HTML dashboard with KPI cards, project table, Security column.
.TP
.B POST /mcp
JSON-RPC 2.0 MCP endpoint. Standard methods:
\fBtools/list\fR, \fBtools/call\fR, \fBinitialize\fR.
.TP
.B /debug/pprof/*
Optional. Only enabled when \fBYAGURA_ENABLE_PPROF=true\fR.
.SH MCP TOOLS
.B yagura_list, yagura_get, yagura_search, yagura_today, yagura_register,
.B yagura_unregister, yagura_update, yagura_stats, yagura_vulns, yagura_scorecard,
.B yagura_health, yagura_secretscan.
.PP
See \fBtools/list\fR JSON-RPC method or the project README for tool schemas.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $YAGURA_STATE_DIR/projects/
One JSON file per registered project (mode 0600).
.TP
.I $YAGURA_STATE_DIR/audit/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl
Append-only audit log with SHA-256 hash chain (mode 0600).
.TP
.I $YAGURA_STATE_DIR/secrets/<name>.enc
Encrypted secret entries (AES-256-GCM + PBKDF2, mode 0600).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success. Daemon shut down cleanly or subcommand completed.
.TP
.B 1
Error. Configuration invalid, audit verification failed, or other fatal error.
.SH SECURITY
.IP \(bu 2
Zero external Go module dependencies (\fIgo.sum\fR is empty by design).
.IP \(bu 2
Reproducible builds verified via \fBmake verify\fR
(byte-for-byte identical with \fI-trimpath -buildvcs=false\fR).
.IP \(bu 2
SLSA Level 3 provenance generated by \fBslsa-github-generator v2.0.0\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
Cosign keyless signing on releases.
.IP \(bu 2
Constant-time MCP token comparison via \fBcrypto/subtle\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
See \fIdocs/security-spec.md\fR for the full STRIDE-based threat model.
